<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DuPont cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DuPont cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said analyst John Roberts downgraded DuPont Co to near-term neutral from accumulate and kept the long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares ended at $112 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
